# --- Credentials: never commit ---------------------------------------
# Real values live in ../hiddenFiles/, which mirrors the deploy paths.
# Bare filenames so these match at ANY depth, not just the resort dirs
# that happened to exist when a rule was written.
dbconfig.php
credentials.properties
config_secure.php
environment.ini
# NOTE: `config.php` above is a per-resort file that IS tracked, holding
# placeholder values only. The ignore rule does not untrack the existing
# copies -- editing one in place on a server can still be committed.
